  "details": "So I repro'd the bug listed here (https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1154-double-pressinf-on-your-own-user-actions-will-show-your-own-user-actions) and tried friending myself, which surprisingly worked. Tried to unfriend myself and it still says I'm friends with myself. \n\nRepro steps: \n\n1.) Click on yourself in the here tab \n\n2.) expand and collapse 'User Actions' rapidly until options appear. \n\n3.) friend yourself, confirm you show up under online friends in the social menu. \n\n4.) unfriend yourself, but see as you are still shown under online friends afterward.",
